  "vosfor": {
    "general": "Loid of Cavia dissolves Arcane into Vosfor. Amount of Vosfor varies depending on the Arcane. Elite Archimedea awards Vosfor when qualifying for Research Points: 20 Vosfor for 28 points and 50 Vosfor for 37 points. Faceoff missions in H\u00f6llvania award varying amounts of Vosfor. A 200 Vosfor Pack can be purchased from any of the six main Syndicates (1=Steel Meridian, 1=Arbiters of Hexis, 1=Cephalon Suda, 1=The Perrin Sequence ,1=Red Veil, or 1=New Loka) at '''Rank 5''' for 30,000 Standing. This offering will only appear after the player has completed Whispers in the Walls. A 200 Vosfor Pack can be purchased from Kaya in H\u00f6llvania for 6 Pix Chips A 200 Vosfor Pack is a possible reward from the 1999 Calendar after completing certain challenges and tasks. During Operation: Atramentum, packs of 200 Vosfor could be purchased for 20 Nightmare Tatters from Aspirant Zorba. Players could purchase up to 7 packs per week.",
    "blueprint": "Loid of Cavia dissolves Arcane into Vosfor. Amount of Vosfor varies depending on the Arcane. Elite Archimedea awards Vosfor when qualifying for Research Points: 20 Vosfor for 28 points and 50 Vosfor for 37 points. Faceoff missions in H\u00f6llvania award varying amounts of Vosfor. A 200 Vosfor Pack can be purchased from any of the six main Syndicates (1=Steel Meridian, 1=Arbiters of Hexis, 1=Cephalon Suda, 1=The Perrin Sequence ,1=Red Veil, or 1=New Loka) at '''Rank 5''' for 30,000 Standing. This offering will only appear after the player has completed Whispers in the Walls. A 200 Vosfor Pack can be purchased from Kaya in H\u00f6llvania for 6 Pix Chips A 200 Vosfor Pack is a possible reward from the 1999 Calendar after completing certain challenges and tasks. During Operation: Atramentum, packs of 200 Vosfor could be purchased for 20 Nightmare Tatters from Aspirant Zorba. Players could purchase up to 7 packs per week."
  },
