    "blueprint": "Yogwun Stomachs are acquired by cutting up Yogwun caught through Fishing. Go to Fisher Hai-Luk in Cetus, select the desired amount of Yogwun available, and select the \"''Cut'' ''Fish''\" option to extract the components. Each Yogwun cut yields one Yogwun Stomach. Alternatively, Fisher Hai-Luk can sell Yogwun Stomachs in bundles of 20 among her rotating stock of \"'''Daily Specials'''\", which can be bought for Platinum."
